# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Klasivo Cloud Functions — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DO NOT put real values here — use Firebase Secrets instead.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Resend (Transactional Email) ────────────────────────────
# Set via:  firebase functions:secrets:set RESEND_API_KEY
# Format:   re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# Used by: emailWorker, sendContactForm

# ─── Sentry (Error Monitoring) ───────────────────────────────
# Set via:  firebase functions:secrets:set SENTRY_DSN
# Format:   https://xxxxx@xxxxx.ingest.sentry.io/xxxxx
#
# Used by: all Cloud Functions

# ─── App Check ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# All callable functions enforce App Check.
# Register your app in Firebase Console → App Check:
#   Android: Play Integrity provider

# ─── RBAC Functions ──────────────────────────────────────────
# assignRole, assignScope, syncClaims, changeUserPassword
# These functions use Firebase Admin SDK (auto-provisioned in
# Cloud Functions) — no additional secrets or env vars needed.

# ─── Runtime ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node.js 22 (firebase.json: runtime: "nodejs22")
# Callable + Firestore triggers: Gen2 (firebase-functions/v2)
# Auth triggers: Gen1 (firebase-functions/v1 — no v2 equivalent)
# RBAC callable functions: Gen1 (firebase-functions/v1 — for custom claims compat)
